I'd have thought that might affect gismu frequency to a slight degree
(e.g. frequency lists based on newspaper corpora show a slight but
perceptible skewing due to text type). But I wouldn't have thought
that it would affect cmavo frequency, unless a whole gang of Lojbanists
retire to a Himalayan monastery to cerebrate in helsemisms.

